flowchart LR
    A[Input image] --> B[Preprocess]
    B --> C{MemAvailable >= 4 GiB}
    C -->|yes| D[VLM process]
    C -->|timeout| X[Safe fail]
    D --> E{exit 0 + JSON valid}
    E -->|no| X
    E -->|yes| F[Confirm VLM PID gone]
    F --> G{MemAvailable >= 12 GiB}
    G -->|timeout| X
    G -->|yes| H[Build grounded prompt]
    H --> I[LLM process]
    I --> J{exit 0 + Markdown gate}
    J -->|no| X
    J -->|yes| K[Atomic output + metrics]
